msgid "每成功闪避一次攻击，下一次攻击必定暴击。"
msgstr ""
"After every successful dodge, the next attack is a guaranteed critical hit."

msgid "百折不挠的真诚"
msgstr "Unwavering Sincerity"

msgid "攻击时有 3% 的概率触发两次伤害。"
msgstr "3% chance to deal double damage on attack."

msgid "直言不讳的勇敢"
msgstr "Outspoken Courage"

msgid "每场战斗随机激活 1 个效果：+50% 伤害 / +30% 防御 / 双倍经验"
msgstr ""
"Randomly activate 1 effect per battle: +50% damage / +30% defense / double "
"EXP."

msgid "空想家"
msgstr "Dreamer"

msgid "击杀一名敌人后，掉落稀有物品的概率 +1%，可叠加，但是生命值低于 50% 时失效。"
msgstr ""
"After killing an enemy, +1% rare drop rate (stackable, inactive if HP < 50%)."

msgid "令人震惊的"
msgstr "Shocking"

msgid "生命低于 20% 时，自动触发“再生”，每秒回复 5% 生命（持续 10 秒，CD 2 分钟）。"
msgstr ""
"When HP is below 20%, auto-trigger 'Regeneration', healing 5% HP per second "
"(lasts 10 seconds, CD 2 minutes)."

msgid "恐慌的"
msgstr "Panicked"

msgid "命中时，5% 几率使敌人无法行动 5 秒。不可重复触发。"
msgstr ""
"On hit, 5% chance to stun the enemy for 5 seconds. Cannot be re-triggered."

msgid "无法忍受的"
msgstr "Unbearable"

msgid "承受切割伤害时，10% 几率反弹 50% 伤害给攻击者。"
msgstr ""
"When taking slicing damage, 10% chance to reflect 50% damage back to the "
"attacker."

msgid "邪恶的"
msgstr "Evil"

msgid "钓鱼速度提升 15%，但 10% 概率什么也不获得。"
msgstr "Fishing speed +15%, but 10% chance to get nothing."

msgid "难以置信的"
msgstr "Incredible"

msgid "砍树时，5% 的概率获得 1 木炭。"
msgstr "When woodcutting, 5% chance to obtain 1 Charcoal."

msgid "搞点货"
msgstr "Supply Run"

msgid "获得的战斗经验降低 30%，但将这部分的 50% 均分给所有非战斗技能。"
msgstr ""
"Combat EXP reduced by 30%, but 50% of that reduction is distributed to all "
"non-combat skills."

msgid "空间管理"
msgstr "Space Management"

msgid "背包格子每空出一格，获得 0.2% 的全局伤害加成；每占用一格，获得 0.2% 的全局减伤。"
msgstr ""
"For every empty bag slot, +0.2% global damage; for every occupied slot, +0.2% "
"global damage reduction."

msgid "麻烦的"
msgstr "Troublesome"

msgid "战斗奖励不会再掉落金币，会选择其他掉落物作为替代。"
msgstr ""
"Combat rewards no longer drop gold, selecting other loot as a replacement."

msgid "一心二用的"
msgstr "Multitasking"

msgid "佩戴并战斗时，考古的速度提升 10%。"
msgstr "When equipped during combat, Archaeology speed increases by 10%."

msgid "底子很好的"
msgstr "Well-Grounded"

msgid "攻击间隔每有 2s，最终伤害 +10%。"
msgstr "For every 2s of attack interval, final damage +10%."

msgid "主角般的"
msgstr "Protagonist"

msgid "敌人对你的命中率提升 20%，但作为回报，敌人掉落稀有物品的概率提升 1.5 倍。"
msgstr "Enemy hit rate on you +20%, but in return, enemy rare drop rate +1.5x."

msgid "形容词的"
msgstr "Adjective"

msgid "你的命中率降低 20%，但你的所有技能的产出倍率增加 10%。"
msgstr "Your hit rate -20%, but all your skill output multipliers +10%."

msgid "哈哈哈"
msgstr "Hahaha"

msgid "训练技能时有 10% 概率播放哈哈的笑声。"
msgstr "10% chance to play laughter when training skills."

msgid "Shift+Tab"
msgstr "Shift+Tab"

msgid "佩戴时，每次打开 Steam 覆盖层 +1 金币。"
msgstr "When equipped, +1 Gold every time you open the Steam overlay."

