msgid "伐木"
msgstr "Woodcutting"

msgid ""
"主要产出：原木、水果\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 原木 → 转化为炭（冶炼、烹饪所需）\n"
"- 原木 → 建造社区基础设施\n"
"- 水果 → 转化为肥料（农业所需）\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 伐木效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：斧头（提高伐木速度）"
msgstr ""
"Main Output: Logs, Fruit\\n\\nUses:\\n- Logs → Convert to Charcoal (needed "
"for smelting, cooking)\\n- Logs → Build community infrastructure\\n- Fruit → "
"Convert to Fertilizer (needed for farming)\\n\\nSkill Bonus: +0.25% "
"Woodcutting Efficiency per level (provides chance to instantly complete "
"action)\\nCore Tool: Axe (improves woodcutting speed)"

msgid "采矿"
msgstr "Mining"

msgid ""
"主要产出：矿石、宝石\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 矿石 → 冶炼成锭\n"
"- 宝石 → 冶炼成宝石精华\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 采矿效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：镐子（提高采矿速度）"
msgstr ""
"Main Output: Ores, Gems\\n\\nUses:\\n- Ores → Smelt into Bars\\n- Gems → "
"Smelt into Gem Essence\\n\\nSkill Bonus: +0.25% Mining Efficiency per level "
"(provides chance to instantly complete action)\\nCore Tool: Pickaxe (improves "
"mining speed)"

msgid "冶炼"
msgstr "Smelting"

msgid ""
"制作内容：\n"
"- 矿石 + 炭 → 锭\n"
"- 宝石 + 炭 → 宝石精华\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 锭和宝石精华 → 锻造武器、工具、盔甲、饰品\n"
"- 锭和宝石精华 → 建造社区基础设施\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 冶炼效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：熔炉（提高冶炼速度）"
msgstr ""
"Production:\n"
"- Ore + Coal → Bar\n"
"- Gem + Coal → Gem Essence\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Bars and Gem Essence → Forge weapons, tools, armor, accessories\n"
"- Bars and Gem Essence → Build community infrastructure\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Smelting efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Building: Furnace (increases smelting speed)"

msgid "锻造"
msgstr "Forging"

msgid ""
"制作内容：武器、工具、盔甲、饰品\n"
"所需材料：锭、宝石精华\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 锻造效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：铁砧（提高锻造速度）"
msgstr ""
"Production: Weapons, tools, armor, accessories\n"
"Required Materials: Bars, Gem Essence\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Forging efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Building: Anvil (increases forging speed)"

msgid "农业"
msgstr "Farming"

msgid ""
"主要产出：鲜花、蔬菜\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 鲜花 → 炼金术制作药水\n"
"- 蔬菜 → 烹饪豪华料理（战斗治疗）\n"
"\n"
"所需材料：\n"
"- 种子（商店购买）\n"
"- 肥料（由水果转化）\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 农业效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：铲子（提高农业速度）"
msgstr ""
"Main Output: Flowers, vegetables\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Flowers → Alchemy potion making\n"
"- Vegetables → Cooking luxury meals (combat healing)\n"
"\n"
"Required Materials:\n"
"- Seeds (buy in shop)\n"
"- Fertilizer (converted from fruit)\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Farming efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Tool: Shovel (increases farming speed)"

msgid "炼金"
msgstr "Alchemy"

msgid ""
"制作内容：各类药水\n"
"\n"
"所需材料：\n"
"- 鲜花（农业）\n"
"- 骨头（战斗）\n"
"- 瓶子（商店）\n"
"\n"
"药水效果：提供多种增益效果，默认持续 180 秒\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 炼金效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：炼金实验室（提高炼金速度）"
msgstr ""
"Production: Various potions\n"
"\n"
"Required Materials:\n"
"- Flowers (Farming)\n"
"- Bones (Combat)\n"
"- Bottles (Shop)\n"
"\n"
"Potion Effects: Provide various buffs, default duration 180 seconds\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Alchemy efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Building: Alchemy Lab (increases alchemy speed)"

msgid "钓鱼"
msgstr "Fishing"

msgid ""
"主要产出：鱼\n"
"用途：烹饪料理（战斗治疗）\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 钓鱼效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：鱼竿（提高钓鱼速度）"
msgstr ""
"Main Output: Fish\n"
"Uses: Cooking meals (combat healing)\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Fishing efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Tool: Fishing Rod (increases fishing speed)"

msgid "烹饪"
msgstr "Cooking"

msgid ""
"制作内容：各类料理\n"
"所需材料：食材（鱼和蔬菜）+ 炭\n"
"料理效果：战斗中生命值低于 33% 时自动使用，恢复生命值（冷却时间 15 秒）\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 烹饪效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：烹饪锅（提高烹饪速度）"
msgstr ""
"Production: Various meals\n"
"Required Materials: Ingredients (fish and vegetables) + Coal\n"
"Meal Effect: Automatically consumed when HP falls below 33% in combat, "
"restores HP (15 second cooldown)\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Cooking efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Building: Cooking Pot (increases cooking speed)"

msgid "狩猎"
msgstr "Hunting"

msgid ""
"主要产出：皮革、墨水、羽毛\n"
"用途：制作地图（制图技能所需）\n"
"所需材料：蚯蚓（钓鱼获得）\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 狩猎效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：陷阱（提高狩猎速度）"
msgstr ""
"Main Output: Leather, ink, feathers\n"
"Uses: Making maps (required for Cartography skill)\n"
"Required Materials: Earthworms (obtained from Fishing)\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Hunting efficiency per level (chance to complete action "
"instantly)\n"
"Core Tool: Trap (increases hunting speed)"

msgid "制图"
msgstr "Cartography"

msgid ""
"制作内容：地图\n"
"所需材料：皮革、墨水、羽毛\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 考古技能消耗品\n"
"- 挑战精英怪物所需\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 制图效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：制图台（提高制图速度）"
msgstr ""
"Production: Maps\n"
"Required Materials: Leather, ink, feathers\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Archaeology skill consumables\n"
"- Required for challenging elite monsters\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Cartography efficiency per level (chance to complete "
"action instantly)\n"
"Core Building: Cartography Table (increases cartography speed)"

msgid "考古"
msgstr "Archaeology"

msgid ""
"特殊机制：被动技能，可与其他技能同时进行\n"
"所需材料：地图\n"
"主要产出：神器\n"
"\n"
"神器系统：\n"
"- 建造祭坛后可激活神器\n"
"- 最多同时激活 3 个神器\n"
"- 激活需要消耗资源\n"
"\n"
"加速方式：使用星星加速考古进度"
msgstr ""
"Special Mechanism: Passive skill, can be performed simultaneously with other "
"skills\n"
"Required Materials: Maps\n"
"Main Output: Artifacts\n"
"\n"
"Artifact System:\n"
"- Artifacts can be activated after building an altar\n"
"- Max 3 artifacts activated at once\n"
"- Activation consumes resources\n"
"\n"
"Speed-up Method: Use stars to accelerate archaeology progress"

