msgstr "One-Handed Weapons"

msgid ""
"武器类型：剑、锤子\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 单手效率（训练时有机会双倍战斗经验和战利品）\n"
"\n"
"命中率机制：\n"
"基础命中率：75%（等级匹配时）\n"
"每高于怪物 1 级：+0.5% 命中率（上限 90%）\n"
"每低于怪物 1 级：-0.5% 命中率"
msgstr ""
"Weapon Type: Sword, Hammer\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% One-Handed efficiency per level (chance for double combat "
"XP and loot while training)\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy Mechanism:\n"
"Base Accuracy: 75% (when levels match)\n"
"Per 1 level higher than monster: +0.5% Accuracy (max 90%)\n"
"Per 1 level lower than monster: -0.5% Accuracy"

